{
 "videos": [
  {
   "id": "n01",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "You get about sixty percent more ideas just by walking.",
     "queries": [
      "man walking street",
      "woman walking city",
      "walking feet"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Researchers had people brainstorm sitting down, then on a treadmill.",
     "queries": [
      "treadmill walking",
      "man sitting desk thinking",
      "treadmill"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Same room. Same blank wall.",
     "queries": [
      "white wall",
      "empty room",
      "office wall"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Walking, their ideas jumped.",
     "queries": [
      "woman idea writing",
      "light bulb",
      "man writing notebook"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "And it lasted after they sat back down.",
     "queries": [
      "woman sitting desk writing",
      "man laptop working",
      "writing notes"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "So when you're stuck, don't stare at the problem.",
     "queries": [
      "man frustrated laptop",
      "woman stressed computer",
      "staring screen"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "Get up and walk. Because",
     "queries": [
      "man standing up office",
      "walking park",
      "walking path"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n02",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Say because, and people agree, even to a pointless reason.",
     "queries": [
      "people queue",
      "people waiting line",
      "woman nodding"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Researchers asked to cut the line at a copy machine.",
     "queries": [
      "photocopier",
      "printer office",
      "office printer paper"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "No reason: sixty percent said yes.",
     "queries": [
      "people waiting",
      "office queue",
      "man shrugging"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Because I have to make copies: ninety-three.",
     "queries": [
      "copying documents",
      "paper printer",
      "office papers"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Everyone there had to make copies.",
     "queries": [
      "office workers",
      "people office",
      "colleagues office"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Your brain hears because and stops checking.",
     "queries": [
      "brain",
      "man nodding",
      "woman agreeing"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "So for small favours, just",
     "queries": [
      "handshake",
      "woman smiling office",
      "people smiling"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n03",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "The same dress sold more at thirty-nine dollars than at thirty-four.",
     "queries": [
      "dress shop",
      "dresses hanger",
      "clothing store"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "A clothing catalog printed different prices for different customers.",
     "queries": [
      "magazine pages",
      "catalog",
      "woman reading magazine"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Thirty-four. Thirty-nine. Forty-four.",
     "queries": [
      "price tag",
      "price tags clothes",
      "sale tag"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "The middle price won.",
     "queries": [
      "woman shopping clothes",
      "shopping bags",
      "woman buying"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "A price ending in nine reads like a deal, even when it costs more.",
     "queries": [
      "sale sign",
      "discount sign",
      "price label"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Your brain grabs the first digit and stops there.",
     "queries": [
      "woman looking shop window",
      "brain",
      "eyes close up"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "That's why, in that catalog,",
     "queries": [
      "magazine",
      "catalog pages",
      "reading magazine"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n04",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Make the cheap chocolate free, and people stop buying the fancy one.",
     "queries": [
      "chocolate truffles",
      "chocolates box",
      "chocolate candy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Researchers sold a fancy truffle for fifteen cents, a cheap chocolate for one.",
     "queries": [
      "chocolate truffle",
      "praline",
      "chocolate shop"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Most bought the truffle.",
     "queries": [
      "woman eating chocolate",
      "eating praline",
      "chocolate bite"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Then both got one cent cheaper.",
     "queries": [
      "coins",
      "coin hand",
      "cents"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Fourteen cents, or free.",
     "queries": [
      "free sign",
      "candy bowl",
      "sweets"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Most grabbed the free one.",
     "queries": [
      "hand taking candy",
      "candy bowl hand",
      "grabbing sweets"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "Free feels better than any discount. That's why, if you",
     "queries": [
      "woman smiling",
      "happy woman shopping",
      "man smiling"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n05",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Almost half the people watching missed a gorilla walking right through the video.",
     "queries": [
      "gorilla",
      "gorilla walking",
      "gorilla face"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Their task: count the passes in a basketball video.",
     "queries": [
      "basketball passing",
      "basketball players",
      "basketball"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Halfway through, a gorilla walks in,",
     "queries": [
      "gorilla walking",
      "gorilla",
      "gorilla zoo"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "thumps its chest, and walks off.",
     "queries": [
      "gorilla chest",
      "gorilla",
      "silverback"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Afterwards they asked: what gorilla?",
     "queries": [
      "man confused",
      "woman confused",
      "people surprised"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "When your brain focuses, it hides everything else.",
     "queries": [
      "man focused phone",
      "woman focused",
      "concentration"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "So next time you're sure nothing happened, remember:",
     "queries": [
      "man thinking",
      "woman thinking",
      "street people"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n06",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "You spend more when your money comes in small change.",
     "queries": [
      "coins hand",
      "coins",
      "change money"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Students got one dollar, to keep or spend on candy.",
     "queries": [
      "dollar bill",
      "candy",
      "sweets shop"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Four quarters? Sixty-three percent spent it.",
     "queries": [
      "coins table",
      "quarters coins",
      "coins falling"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "One bill? Only twenty-six percent.",
     "queries": [
      "dollar bill hand",
      "banknote",
      "money bill"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Same dollar.",
     "queries": [
      "money",
      "dollar",
      "cash"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Your brain guards a big note, and lets small change go.",
     "queries": [
      "wallet",
      "coin jar",
      "piggy bank"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "So to save more, carry bigger notes. Because",
     "queries": [
      "banknotes wallet",
      "money wallet",
      "saving money"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n07",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "More money keeps making most people happier, way past seventy-five thousand.",
     "queries": [
      "money happy",
      "happy woman money",
      "dollar bills"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Even the scientist behind that famous limit helped test it.",
     "queries": [
      "scientist",
      "researcher computer",
      "laboratory"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Thirty-three thousand workers rated their mood on their phones.",
     "queries": [
      "phone notification",
      "woman phone",
      "people phones"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Happiness kept rising, up to half a million a year.",
     "queries": [
      "luxury house",
      "happy family",
      "money"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Only the unhappiest fifth levelled off, around a hundred thousand.",
     "queries": [
      "sad man window",
      "sad woman",
      "lonely man"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Money fixes money problems, not heartbreak.",
     "queries": [
      "heartbreak",
      "sad couple",
      "woman crying"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "But for everyone else,",
     "queries": [
      "woman smiling",
      "man smiling",
      "family park"
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}